{"$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/guitaripod/wwdc-sessions/master/schema/transcript.schema.json", "id": "wwdc2019-253", "language": "eng", "source": "https://developer.apple.com/videos/play/wwdc2019/253", "wordCount": 940, "segments": [{"start": 7.0, "text": "Hi. My name is Jared McGann."}, {"start": 9.0, "text": "I'm an engineering manager in"}, {"start": 10.0, "text": "watchOS."}, {"start": 11.0, "text": "In watchOS 5, Apple released the"}, {"start": 14.0, "text": "new Infograph clock faces with"}, {"start": 16.0, "text": "graphic complications."}, {"start": 18.0, "text": "In watchOS 6, we've enhanced"}, {"start": 20.0, "text": "graphic complications with a new"}, {"start": 22.0, "text": "tinted mode."}, {"start": 23.0, "text": "Any clock face with graphic"}, {"start": 26.0, "text": "complications supports tinted"}, {"start": 27.0, "text": "complications."}, {"start": 29.0, "text": "Here's some more examples from"}, {"start": 30.0, "text": "our new watch faces in watchOS"}, {"start": 32.0, "text": "6."}, {"start": 33.0, "text": "These graphic complications are"}, {"start": 34.0, "text": "composed of three data types;"}, {"start": 36.0, "text": "gauges, text, and images."}, {"start": 39.0, "text": "The system alters the appearance"}, {"start": 40.0, "text": "of each into contexts."}, {"start": 42.0, "text": "Let's walk through each one."}, {"start": 44.0, "text": "In tinted context, gauges are"}, {"start": 46.0, "text": "displayed as a solid color"}, {"start": 48.0, "text": "rather than a color gradient."}, {"start": 51.0, "text": "The color of the gauge is"}, {"start": 52.0, "text": "determined by the system, as"}, {"start": 54.0, "text": "informed by the customer's color"}, {"start": 55.0, "text": "selection."}, {"start": 56.0, "text": "If your complication relies on"}, {"start": 58.0, "text": "color to communicate information"}, {"start": 59.0, "text": "within the gauge, you may need"}, {"start": 61.0, "text": "to reconsider how you display"}, {"start": 62.0, "text": "that information in your"}, {"start": 63.0, "text": "complication."}, {"start": 66.0, "text": "Text is also displayed with a"}, {"start": 68.0, "text": "single color in tinted contexts."}, {"start": 70.0, "text": "Again, the color is determined"}, {"start": 71.0, "text": "by the system, based on the"}, {"start": 72.0, "text": "customer's color choice."}, {"start": 74.0, "text": "Multicolor text providers are"}, {"start": 76.0, "text": "reduced to a single color, as"}, {"start": 78.0, "text": "seen in the activity rings"}, {"start": 79.0, "text": "complication."}, {"start": 83.0, "text": "Lastly, images are desaturated"}, {"start": 85.0, "text": "by default in tinted contexts,"}, {"start": 87.0, "text": "but we also have new API to"}, {"start": 89.0, "text": "provide alternate images in this"}, {"start": 91.0, "text": "mode."}, {"start": 93.0, "text": "Before we dive into the new API,"}, {"start": 95.0, "text": "I'd like to take a step back and"}, {"start": 96.0, "text": "talk about data providers"}, {"start": 98.0, "text": "generally."}, {"start": 99.0, "text": "ClockKit includes a number of"}, {"start": 100.0, "text": "data providers for"}, {"start": 101.0, "text": "complications."}, {"start": 103.0, "text": "These providers manage the data"}, {"start": 104.0, "text": "you supply to ClockKit for"}, {"start": 106.0, "text": "display within a complication."}, {"start": 110.0, "text": "Let's take a look at the full"}, {"start": 111.0, "text": "color image provider."}, {"start": 114.0, "text": "The image property specifies a"}, {"start": 116.0, "text": "full-color image to be displayed"}, {"start": 117.0, "text": "by a complication."}, {"start": 119.0, "text": "Then there's an accessibility"}, {"start": 121.0, "text": "label property, which is a"}, {"start": 122.0, "text": "succinct label that identifies"}, {"start": 124.0, "text": "the purpose of the image."}, {"start": 125.0, "text": "So how do you provide an"}, {"start": 127.0, "text": "alternate image for tinted"}, {"start": 128.0, "text": "contexts?"}, {"start": 130.0, "text": "In watchOS 6 there's a new"}, {"start": 132.0, "text": "property in"}, {"start": 133.0, "text": "CLKFullColorImageProvider called"}, {"start": 135.0, "text": "tintedImageProvider."}, {"start": 137.0, "text": "It's an optional property where"}, {"start": 138.0, "text": "you can provide a separate image"}, {"start": 140.0, "text": "for tinted contexts if you don't"}, {"start": 141.0, "text": "want the full color image to be"}, {"start": 143.0, "text": "desaturated."}, {"start": 145.0, "text": "This property is of the type"}, {"start": 146.0, "text": "CLKImageProvider."}, {"start": 149.0, "text": "We chose this class because it"}, {"start": 150.0, "text": "allows you to provide both"}, {"start": 151.0, "text": "one-piece and two-piece template"}, {"start": 152.0, "text": "images for tinted contexts."}, {"start": 157.0, "text": "Let's take a closer look at"}, {"start": 158.0, "text": "CLKImageProvider, which has been"}, {"start": 160.0, "text": "around since watchOS 2."}, {"start": 162.0, "text": "The first thing to note is that"}, {"start": 164.0, "text": "CLKFullColorImageProvider is not"}, {"start": 166.0, "text": "derived from CLKImageProvider."}, {"start": 168.0, "text": "These are two distinct classes."}, {"start": 171.0, "text": "This class, CLKImageProvider,"}, {"start": 173.0, "text": "manages template images for"}, {"start": 175.0, "text": "display in a complication."}, {"start": 176.0, "text": "The clock face displaying the"}, {"start": 178.0, "text": "complication determines how to"}, {"start": 179.0, "text": "display the image and what tint"}, {"start": 181.0, "text": "color to apply."}, {"start": 183.0, "text": "The first property is one-piece"}, {"start": 185.0, "text": "image, which is a single"}, {"start": 186.0, "text": "template image."}, {"start": 188.0, "text": "This is the only required"}, {"start": 189.0, "text": "property."}, {"start": 191.0, "text": "Next up is tint color."}, {"start": 193.0, "text": "In some classic complication"}, {"start": 194.0, "text": "contexts, this color is applied"}, {"start": 196.0, "text": "to the template image within a"}, {"start": 197.0, "text": "complication."}, {"start": 199.0, "text": "In graphic complications, tint"}, {"start": 201.0, "text": "color is ignored because color"}, {"start": 202.0, "text": "is determined by the system as"}, {"start": 204.0, "text": "influenced by the customer's"}, {"start": 205.0, "text": "color selection."}, {"start": 207.0, "text": "Then, there are two-piece"}, {"start": 209.0, "text": "images, which are composed of"}, {"start": 210.0, "text": "the two-piece image background"}, {"start": 212.0, "text": "and two-piece image foreground"}, {"start": 214.0, "text": "properties."}, {"start": 217.0, "text": "Classic complications use"}, {"start": 219.0, "text": "two-piece images in multicolor"}, {"start": 221.0, "text": "contexts, as seen here."}, {"start": 223.0, "text": "Graphic complications use"}, {"start": 225.0, "text": "two-piece images in some tinted"}, {"start": 226.0, "text": "contexts."}, {"start": 228.0, "text": "When applicable, two-piece"}, {"start": 229.0, "text": "images take priority over"}, {"start": 231.0, "text": "one-piece images."}, {"start": 232.0, "text": "A two-piece image consists of a"}, {"start": 234.0, "text": "foreground image layered on top"}, {"start": 236.0, "text": "of a background image."}, {"start": 238.0, "text": "Both images are template images."}, {"start": 240.0, "text": "In classic complications, the"}, {"start": 241.0, "text": "color and the tint color"}, {"start": 242.0, "text": "property is applied to the"}, {"start": 244.0, "text": "background image and white to"}, {"start": 246.0, "text": "the foreground image."}, {"start": 247.0, "text": "In tinted graphic complications,"}, {"start": 249.0, "text": "as previously mentioned, tint"}, {"start": 251.0, "text": "color is ignored."}, {"start": 252.0, "text": "The system will determine the"}, {"start": 253.0, "text": "foreground and background colors"}, {"start": 255.0, "text": "as informed by the customer's"}, {"start": 257.0, "text": "color selection."}, {"start": 260.0, "text": "Let's walk through a few"}, {"start": 261.0, "text": "scenarios for displaying images"}, {"start": 263.0, "text": "within a tinted graphic"}, {"start": 264.0, "text": "complication."}, {"start": 266.0, "text": "The first is for the full color"}, {"start": 267.0, "text": "image to appear desaturated in"}, {"start": 269.0, "text": "tinted contexts."}, {"start": 270.0, "text": "Here, we see the full color"}, {"start": 272.0, "text": "image desaturated, more or less"}, {"start": 273.0, "text": "gray scale on the right."}, {"start": 275.0, "text": "To achieve this in code, merely"}, {"start": 279.0, "text": "initialize a CLKFullColorImageProvider"}, {"start": 281.0, "text": "without a tintedImageProvider,"}, {"start": 283.0, "text": "as seen here."}, {"start": 285.0, "text": "When the tintedImageProvider"}, {"start": 286.0, "text": "property is nil, the system"}, {"start": 288.0, "text": "displays a desaturated version"}, {"start": 290.0, "text": "of the full color image."}, {"start": 294.0, "text": "In other scenarios, you may want"}, {"start": 295.0, "text": "to display an alternate template"}, {"start": 296.0, "text": "image in tinted contexts."}, {"start": 298.0, "text": "Perhaps your full color image"}, {"start": 300.0, "text": "doesn't desaturate well, or"}, {"start": 301.0, "text": "maybe you're concerned about a"}, {"start": 302.0, "text": "logo being displayed in"}, {"start": 303.0, "text": "undesirable colors."}, {"start": 307.0, "text": "To do this in code, create a"}, {"start": 308.0, "text": "CLKImageProvider with the"}, {"start": 310.0, "text": "desired one-piece template"}, {"start": 311.0, "text": "image."}, {"start": 312.0, "text": "Then supply that in the"}, {"start": 314.0, "text": "CLKFullColorImageProvider"}, {"start": 316.0, "text": "initializer alongside the full"}, {"start": 318.0, "text": "color image."}, {"start": 319.0, "text": "In full color context, ClockKit"}, {"start": 321.0, "text": "will utilize the full color"}, {"start": 322.0, "text": "image."}, {"start": 323.0, "text": "In tinted contexts, the"}, {"start": 324.0, "text": "one-piece image from the"}, {"start": 325.0, "text": "CLKImageProvider will be"}, {"start": 327.0, "text": "utilized."}, {"start": 330.0, "text": "It's worth noting that you can"}, {"start": 332.0, "text": "also provide the same full color"}, {"start": 333.0, "text": "image within the"}, {"start": 334.0, "text": "tintedImageProvider, and that"}, {"start": 336.0, "text": "image will be templatized"}, {"start": 337.0, "text": "instead of desaturated."}, {"start": 339.0, "text": "We use this technique in many of"}, {"start": 341.0, "text": "the standard watchOS"}, {"start": 342.0, "text": "complications."}, {"start": 345.0, "text": "Lastly, you may want to provide"}, {"start": 347.0, "text": "an alternate two-piece image in"}, {"start": 349.0, "text": "tinted contexts."}, {"start": 352.0, "text": "To achieve this, create a"}, {"start": 354.0, "text": "CLKImageProvider with both"}, {"start": 356.0, "text": "one-piece and two-piece template"}, {"start": 358.0, "text": "images."}, {"start": 359.0, "text": "Then supply this object in the"}, {"start": 360.0, "text": "CLKFullColorImageProvider"}, {"start": 362.0, "text": "initializer alongside the full"}, {"start": 365.0, "text": "color image."}, {"start": 366.0, "text": "In tinted contexts, ClockKit"}, {"start": 368.0, "text": "will determine if the one-piece"}, {"start": 369.0, "text": "or two-piece image should be"}, {"start": 371.0, "text": "utilized."}, {"start": 373.0, "text": "Here's a chart from the Human"}, {"start": 375.0, "text": "Interface Guidelines with"}, {"start": 376.0, "text": "various graphic complication"}, {"start": 377.0, "text": "layouts."}, {"start": 380.0, "text": "And here you can see the same"}, {"start": 382.0, "text": "layouts in a tinted environment."}, {"start": 386.0, "text": "Remember that ClockKit will"}, {"start": 388.0, "text": "alter the appearance of complications in tinted"}, {"start": 390.0, "text": "contexts."}, {"start": 391.0, "text": "Tint color in tinted graphic"}, {"start": 393.0, "text": "complications is determined by"}, {"start": 394.0, "text": "the system, as informed by the"}, {"start": 396.0, "text": "customer's color selection."}, {"start": 398.0, "text": "And lastly, we've supplied new"}, {"start": 400.0, "text": "API that allows you to provide"}, {"start": 402.0, "text": "alternate template images to be"}, {"start": 403.0, "text": "displayed in tinted contexts."}, {"start": 408.0, "text": "If you're new to complications"}, {"start": 409.0, "text": "or would like to learn more,"}, {"start": 411.0, "text": "check out these videos on"}]}
